//
//  What this file does
//  -------------------
//  The demo DAB multiplex's programme data, exactly as OFFgrid-SDR's JS
//  embeds it (diddy-boy, https://github.com/solariun/offgrid-sdr,
//  index.html: <script type="text/plain"> blocks id="dabdemoplus",
//  "dabdemomp2", "dabdemospi"), base64:
//    - dabdemoplus: 480 CIFs of 144 bytes (96 DAB+ super frames of 720
//      bytes, Reed-Solomon parity included): "OFFgrid Plus", the demo
//      jingle in AAC, with station text and a SlideShow in its PAD;
//    - dabdemomp2: 480 CIFs of 144 bytes: "OFFgrid Classic", the jingle as
//      MPEG Layer II frames at 48 kbit/s, with PAD;
//    - dabdemospi: 480 CIFs of 48 bytes: the SPI service's packets (packet
//      address 1), the station logos (MOT directory mode).
//  (480 CIFs = 120 frames = 11.52 s, the demo's loop.)
//
//  How it fits in
//  --------------
//  Read by DabEncoders.cpp (dec::DabDemoMultiplex) through demoPlus(),
//  demoMp2(), demoSpi() (DabInternal.h).  Kept in pieces of 4000
//  characters: no compiler's string literal limit is near.  Generated from
//  index.html with sed/fold; regenerate rather than edit by hand.
//
//  Contributing
//  ------------
//  If the JS's demo blocks change, regenerate this file from them (the
//  three lines of index.html), so the TUI's demo matches the browser's.
// ============================================================================
